	"_note": "Genzo, an old rice farmer of Kaminoda (the hamlet north of the village), who has worked its terraces all his life. Up at six in his house; from 7:00 he walks his paddies (the terraces top left, then after lunch the lower ones, along the dike between them), lunch at home, a drink of water at the well at 17:00, home at 17:30, asleep from 20:00. Wet days he stays in by his hearth. On his birthday (summer 13, when the paddies stand green and the weeding is done) the weeding waits: home in the morning, then a long sit by the well 10:00-14:00, home again after. His heart events: data/events/heart_genzo.json (band 3), heart_genzo_5.json (band 5). Gifts: rice and rice dishes, plain hot food; no sweets; a daruma for luck and a bit of gold ore please him. Format: README.md, Villagers.",
